{"title":"Goats on the Rock","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>The wolf pack at Alpha&#39;s Rock has been carrying off Trevor Barthrone&#39;s goats, and Old Ironjaw leads it.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/trevor-barthrone\">Trevor Barthrone</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"trevor-barthrone\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Long</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/sunbleached-fang\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\">Sunbleached Fang</a> <b>×6</b></li><li><a href=\"#/item/ironjaw-hide\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/72c65e329d1e47634e70.svg\" alt=\"\">Ironjaw Hide</a> <b>×1</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/trevor-barthrone\">Trevor Barthrone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Agauton)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"trevor-barthrone\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Kill 20 desert wolves <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span><br>Bring Trevor Barthrone 6 sunbleached fangs <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/sunbleached-fang\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\">Sunbleached Fang</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 1161, 241</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1161|241|Bring Trevor Barthrone 6 sunbleached fangs\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"3\">Kill 3 dune alphas <span class=\"muted\">(3)</span></li><li value=\"4\">Kill Old Ironjaw <span class=\"muted\">at 995, 435</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"995|435|Kill Old Ironjaw\">Show on map</button><br>Bring Egle Barthrone Old Ironjaw&#39;s hide - <a href=\"#/item/ironjaw-hide\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/72c65e329d1e47634e70.svg\" alt=\"\">Ironjaw Hide</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 1150, 247</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1150|247|Bring Egle Barthrone Old Ironjaw&#39;s hide\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"5\">Kill 20 desert wolves <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span><br>Bring Trevor Barthrone 6 sunbleached fangs <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/sunbleached-fang\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\">Sunbleached Fang</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 1170, 241</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1170|241|Bring Trevor Barthrone 6 sunbleached fangs\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>3,840</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>120,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Goats on the Rock</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-g